From b3b748d68c163d2a6f4becae116e063662ee89f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rohit Agrawal <rohit.agrawal@databricks.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 02:02:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] dynamic_modules: add formatter dynamic modules extension
 (#45494)

## Description

This PR adds a new `CommandParserFactory` dynamic module extension so
module authors can implement custom `%COMMAND%` access-log and header
formatting operators in Rust or Go without forking Envoy.

---

**Commit Message**: dynamic_modules: add formatter dynamic modules
extension
**Additional Description**: Added a new `CommandParserFactory` dynamic
module extension.
**Risk Level:** Low
**Testing:** Added Unit + Integration Tests
**Docs Changes:** Added
**Release Notes:** Added

---------

Signed-off-by: Rohit Agrawal <rohit.agrawal@databricks.com>
